lg:AT-ASTG-s19-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "cc38124e9d22f41b08497794a9e018a1911be0dd4e9cecee8377d28bff905e03" ;
    lgo:text "(1) An entrepreneur shall inform consumers about the alternative dispute resolution body or bodies by which it is covered, provided that it has committed or is obliged to use those bodies for the settlement of disputes with consumers. This information shall include details of the website address of the alternative dispute resolution body or bodies concerned."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-ASTG-s19-1-q1 .

lg:AT-ASTG-s19-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2ff43da78a691ef442a7de95a6a189d57c4f2ebac3b1448e721c4d2ceecd0698" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The entrepreneur shall provide the information referred to in paragraph 1, where available, on its website and, where applicable, in its general terms and conditions in a clear, comprehensible and easily accessible manner."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-ASTG-s19-2-q1 .

lg:AT-ASTG-s19-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5b2cb44dd9758c8bcbcec21788c5b9ea42c5ad19c42f93c74b3fdb12a345f999" ;
    lgo:text "(3) Where the entrepreneur and the consumer are unable to reach agreement in a dispute, the entrepreneur shall inform the consumer, on paper or another durable medium, of the alternative dispute resolution body or bodies competent for it. The entrepreneur shall also state whether it will participate in a procedure."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-ASTG-s19-3-q1 .

lg:AT-ASTG-title-d32926411ac1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "d32926411ac18d5e5777ab77bd5da7fd6c9d16cf4973d5803e6e68aa4973723f" ;
    lgo:text "Federal Act on Alternative Dispute Resolution in Consumer Matters (AStG)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-ASTG .

lg:AT-BAFG-s14-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "03179d113854984cb67c9fafdc044905a37cdf7924ae7fb13e6acbc683f02bc6" ;
    lgo:text "(1) The service provider may only offer or provide services that are designed, offered and provided in accordance with the accessibility requirements pursuant to § 4(3)."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s14-1-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s14-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "415bb1d2888607003718860a7cfd8b9dc91198b587fb8ecdea191c3f6babba13" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The service provider must create the necessary information pursuant to Annex 3 and make that information available to the general public in written and oral form, including in a form accessible to people with disabilities. The service provider must keep the information for the duration of the offer of the service."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s14-2-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s2-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "3f5020a406dbd9cec73c05df5173722a96e06c0a54ebdbdf6a9333b2497a8457" ;
    lgo:text """(2) This federal act applies to the following services provided to consumers after 28 June 2025:
1. electronic communications services, with the exception of emergency calls and transmission services for providing machine-to-machine communication services;
2. services that provide access to audiovisual media services;
3. the following elements of passenger transport services in air, bus, rail and water transport, with the exception of urban, suburban and regional transport services, for which only lit. e applies:
a) websites;
b) services offered on mobile devices, including mobile applications;
c) electronic tickets and electronic ticketing services;
d) the provision of information relating to the transport service, including real-time travel information, whereby this is limited to information screens as interactive screens in the territory of the European Union;
e) interactive self-service terminals in the territory of the European Union, with the exception of terminals installed as integral parts of vehicles, aircraft, ships or trains and used for providing such passenger transport services;
4. banking services for consumers;
5. e-books and software specifically intended for them;
6. services in electronic commerce."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s2-2-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s2-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "05a9c7f7c4e85c8183fd9d8a1e3a4ed55897821712152036b89e33e0595d18fb" ;
    lgo:text """(3) This federal act does not apply to the following content of websites and mobile applications:
1. pre-recorded time-based media published before 28 June 2025;
2. file formats of office applications published before 28 June 2025;
3. online maps and map services, provided that essential information for navigation purposes is made accessible in digital form;
4. content of third parties that is neither financed nor developed by the economic operator concerned nor under its control;
5. content of websites and mobile applications that count as archives and whose content is therefore neither updated nor revised after 28 June 2025."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s2-3-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s4-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "016860ade6813e97acf786867611722f12922152434f0c63b64e610552e3e6dd" ;
    lgo:text "(1) Economic operators may only place products on the market and only offer or provide services that meet the accessibility requirements under this federal act."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s4-1-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s4-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "732e6a3b4deb6d9c22153058006907eb5d7641b579edf3d58ce80cbf9a8bd34e" ;
    lgo:text "(3) The accessibility requirements laid down in Sections 3 and 4 of Annex 1 apply to services, with the exception of urban, suburban and regional transport services, for which only the accessibility requirements laid down in Section 4 of Annex 1 apply."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s4-3-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-s6-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "70accc2fcd9cc51026debe7b7f9736cf4dd158747301211ce96e0cc4dfd2d576" ;
    lgo:text "(1) Microenterprises that offer or provide services are exempt from compliance with the accessibility requirements pursuant to § 4(3) and from all obligations in connection with compliance with those requirements."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-BAFG-s6-1-q1 .

lg:AT-BAFG-title-565870298466-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "565870298466d7e2181281791348592af613893d1531a882dff46f793d79ca06" ;
    lgo:text "Federal Act on Accessibility Requirements for Products and Services (Accessibility Act – BaFG)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
